{"year":"2021","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 74th BAFTA Film Awards were held on April 10 and 11, 2021, at the Royal Albert Hall in London, with Edith Bowman and Dermot O'Leary hosting the main ceremony. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 581734, 'screen_type': movie}\">Nomadland</a> (2021) and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 575773, 'screen_type': movie}\">Rocks</a> (2020) led the nominations, with seven each, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1395183, 'screen_type': person}\">Chloé Zhao</a>'s film won four awards, including Best Film and Best Director. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 4173, 'screen_type': person}\">Anthony Hopkins</a> won Best Leading Actor for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 600354, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Father</a> (2020), and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 3910, 'screen_type': person}\">Frances McDormand</a> won Best Leading Actress."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":581734,"name":"Nomadland","image_path":"/pLwarSuyUjw6vF0U6JhlHzAa1Gp.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":600354,"name":"The Father","image_path":"/85d7NFk3BnoaJr1NnH3gLl2lRCU.jpg","director":"Florian Zeller","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":644583,"name":"The Mauritanian","image_path":"/W5Keg8TT9hYfEpIWCawh9dXjXf.jpg","director":"Kevin Macdonald","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":582014,"name":"Promising Young Woman","image_path":"/r7FwclLTWB8i6XfBNTtUsyONlgN.jpg","director":"Emerald Fennell","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":556984,"name":"The Trial of the Chicago 7","image_path":"/xvJJmdHVmOOn258tkCe6z83AYuP.jpg","director":"Aaron Sorkin","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Outstanding British Film","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":582014,"name":"Promising Young Woman","image_path":"/r7FwclLTWB8i6XfBNTtUsyONlgN.jpg","director":"Emerald Fennell","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":574396,"nam